{"title":"2016 UMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all positive integer pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/5/625adc7907a33cb93776cbe286045d5da1143305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(u,m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/9/1a9a02856336876d182b0dea82d35c43a5d9e061.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$u + m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/0/b605cb378246d43baf9c243a596b41d2422ce335.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$um-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/b/68bae9f106ea417f9ddc13cec9ec42cbb3fe1bc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2),(1,3),(2,1),(2,2),(2,5),(3,1),(3,5),(5,2),(5,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"426\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_UMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</